Kernel headers
--------------
Lineage 20 always generates the kernel UAPI headers (device_kernel_headers
is rewritten to generated_kernel_headers) by running headers_install on
TARGET_KERNEL_SOURCE, so the build needs kernel source even with a
prebuilt kernel. libtinycompress is the user in this build. Check out
AOSP kernel/common at the commit the 6.6 port is based on; the port
changes no UAPI header, so these match the prebuilt kernel. Add to
.repo/local_manifests/ and repo sync that path:

  <project path="kernel/samsung/universal7420-6.6" name="kernel/common" remote="aosp" revision="33f64c1712cc700513431ed498b35db84c20d411" upstream="android15-6.6" clone-depth="1" />

The "aosp" remote fetches from https://android.googlesource.com.
Nothing in this checkout is compiled.
